   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Accountable Grant OHM0901: CHILDREN AND YOUNG PEOPLE AT THE CENTRE OF DISASTER RISK REDUCTION is a component of Disaster Risk Reduction Projects in Conflict Humanitarian Fund 2005 reported by FCDO with a funding type of 111 - Not for profit organisation and a budget of &#xa3;1,038,830. This project benefits Developing countries, unspecified. It works in the following sector(s): Education policy and administrative management, Social Protection, Environmental education/training, Democratic participation and civil society.</narrative>
